# AgriSmart AI — environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env` for local work, or set these as environment secrets in the app
# dashboard (Settings → environment variables). No real values belong in this file.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required for physical device ingestion
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shared token a physical ESP32 / ESP8266 node must present when it posts a
# reading. Until this is set, POST /functions/ingestReading answers with
# `configuration_missing` and the app reports device ingestion as not configured.
# Generate it with something like: openssl rand -hex 32
IOT_INGEST_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: live weather provider (not implemented in this milestone)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The weather page and irrigation engine currently take a hand-entered rainfall
# figure, clearly labelled as hand-entered. Adding a provider key would let live
# conditions be fetched; no code reads this yet.
WEATHER_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Provided by the platform — do not set these yourself
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BASE44_APP_ID is injected into backend functions automatically.